  "published": "2026-04-20T03:09:00.737Z",
  "releaseNotes": "- Fix: `Caching.hashString` now disposes the `SHA1` instance after use; on .NET 5+ uses `SHA1.HashData` (static, pool-backed) to avoid allocation entirely (PR #1745)\n- Fix: WorldBank type provider now waits 2 seconds between HTTP retries, making it resilient to transient 502 errors from the WorldBank API (PR #1749)\n- Eng: update `FSharp.TypeProviders.SDK` to latest master (`75ac6119`), pulling in a bug fix for the SDK logger and O(1) field/event/property lookups (PR #1741)",
